---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import ContactButtons from '../components/ContactButtons.astro';
import Makes from '../components/Makes.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Custom Kundan Jewellery in Delhi | Patel Kundan Art"
  description="Custom kundan and jadau jewellery made to order in Karol Bagh, Delhi. Bring a design, an idea, or old gold you would like remade by hand."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="For individuals"
    title="One piece, made properly, for you."
    lede="Anyone can have a piece made here. Bring a design, an idea, or gold you already own, and we will make it for you by hand."
  >
    <ContactButtons message="custom" waLabel="WhatsApp us about a custom piece" />
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">What people come to us for</p>
      <div class="two">
        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Remaking old gold</h2>
          <p>
            This is most of what people come to us for now. Jewellery that sits in
            a locker: a set from a wedding a generation ago, pieces from two sides
            of a family, something broken or simply out of fashion.
          </p>
          <p>
            You already own the gold. What you are paying for is the making, which
            is a far smaller number than buying the same piece new.
          </p>
          <p>
            Before anything is melted, we tell you exactly what you have. The old
            piece is weighed in front of you, and what comes back is weighed the same way.
          </p>
          <ContactButtons class="cta" message="remake" waLabel="Ask about remaking old gold" showCall={false} />
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Made to your design</h2>
          <p>
            A bridal set, a single piece for an occasion, or something you saw once
            and have wanted ever since. Tell us about it and we will work out the
            design with you.
          </p>
          <p>
            Kundan and jadau are what we are known for. Most of our work is in gold,
            and silver pieces get the same care. If a design needs a different
            specialist, we will tell you at the start.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Makes />

  <section class="section on-sunk">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose">
      <h2>What to expect</h2>
      <p>
        Every piece is made by hand from the first sketch, so it takes time. We
        give you a date before you commit, and it is a date we keep.
      </p>
      <p>
        Each piece is priced on its own, because each one is different. Call or
        WhatsApp us and we will tell you what it will weigh and what the work
        involves, before you commit to anything.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section on-ink page-close">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <h2>Tell us about the piece you have in mind.</h2>
      <p class="lede">We will tell you what is possible and how we would make it.</p>
      <ContactButtons message="custom" waLabel="WhatsApp us about a custom piece" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .two { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  @media (min-width: 800px) { .two { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3.5rem; } }
  .cta { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
